10:43:38.457 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [Claude Code] ## Why This Solves the Problems
10:43:38.458 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [Claude Code] 
10:43:38.458 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [Claude Code] The issues occurred because Diffblue Cover was trying to test these methods and needed to create TAQWriter instances. When it used File-based constructors, temporary files were created but not cleaned up within the test execution.
